t=1787877425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958460/extras/7cfb6096c4203f50ab043bac12b1c03e.mp4?t=1787877425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Never Underestimate the Power of Bonds!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the echoes and bring the girls of Gensokyo back home. Spend time with them, deepen your bonds, gain their support and new powers, then carry that strength with you as you venture deeper into the Bansho Card Corridor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958460/extras/8d69f0155f5a65c2795eefdf5c922b3a.poster.avif?t=1787877425\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958460/extras/8d69f0155f5a65c2795eefdf5c922b3a.webm?t=1787877425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958460/extras/8d69f0155f5a65c2795eefdf5c922b3a.mp4?t=1787877425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards of the same type back-to-back, build your Combo higher, and make every card that follows hit harder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Spell Cards and dice, reshape your deck through events, and fuse cards into devastating combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ever-changing Bansho Card Corridor, with different events, rewards, and challenges on every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Reimu Hakurei, Marisa Kirisame, or Sanae Kochiya, each with their own abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat echoes, rescue the girls of Gensokyo, and gain new support and powers through your bonds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Fight to the end! Once a card is played, don't stop. Push the Combo higher, break the damage limit, and blast through anything in your way! Touhou Bansho Cards is a roguelike deckbuilder. Collect cards, explore the Bansho Card Corridor, defeat Echoes, rescue Gensokyo's girls, uncover the truth.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958460/1a01b7d886c8771eb301bc27911e65c5414f9485/header.jpg?t=1787877425", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958460/92a2ab123c660ad3db709dce8f74b5da880e2e35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787877425", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4958460/92a2ab123c660ad3db709dce8f74b5da880e2e35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787877425", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 12-compatible graphics card with 1 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound card</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 G